    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Artifact_7M40e0r0zZoJalb859Ds-9">
      <bpmn:text>Eksport shartnoma shartlariga asosan to&apos;lov turlari: SHA – komissiya tomonlar o‘rtasida taqsimlanadi OUR – barcha komissiya jo‘natuvchi tomonidan to‘lanadi BEN – barcha komissiya oluvchi tomonidan to‘lanadi</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Fa6rxyzzGSH9l0jOlQq_-13">
      <bpmn:text>Ochilgan akkreditiv bo&apos;yicha xabarnoma ijrosiz qoldiriladi</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="aGxHGp6TTQlija1iIJ3h-13">
      <bpmn:text>Vakil bank vositachilik haqi eksport tushumidan ushlab qolinadigan bo‘lsa, u debitorlik qarzi emas, eksport qiluvchining xarajati hisoblanadi</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="yTAdOy0KQ8wUDuWC6gal-5">
      <bpmn:text>Taqdim etiladigan hujjatlar to&apos;plami: 1. Pasport 2. Ishonchnoma 3.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="AaVGfOstme-ttgCn2zrt-16">
      <bpmn:text>Taqdim etilgan hujjatlar to&apos;plamini dasturga yuklash</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Fa6rxyzzGSH9l0jOlQq_-5">
      <bpmn:text>Naqd valyuta pul mablag&apos;lari SQB mijozi tomonidan kirim qilish uchun taqdim etilganda: 1. Pasport 2. Ishonchnoma 3. Valyuta mablag&apos;larining kelib chiqishini tasdiqlovchi hujjatlar taqdim etiladi</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="b7Lt_HDzJ7J8rntQ8rc2-12">
      <bpmn:text>Ayriboshlash maqsadi, o&apos;tkazma to&apos;g&apos;riligini tekshirish</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="gLwxnTmAdxCENryWZi5o-1">
      <bpmn:text>Bunda eksport shartnomasi (mavjud bo&apos;lsa qo&apos;shimcha kelishuvlar, bajarilgan ishlar bo&apos;yicha dalolatnoma va boshqa zarur hujjatlar Pdf ko&apos;rinishda biriktirilganligi) bo&apos;yicha ma&apos;lumotlar to&apos;liq va to&apos;g&apos;ri aks ettirilganligi hamda to&apos;lovlar bo&apos;yicha hisob-kitoblar to&apos;g&apos;riligini tekshirish</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="i3MSfDVvlFJBW9Vb87Vz-67">
      <bpmn:text>1. Mijoz ulangan tarif paketida imtiyoz nazarda tutilgan bo&apos;lsa. 2. Bank mahsulotlari boshqarish kichik qo&apos;mitasi qarori bilan imtiyoz berilgan bo&apos;lsa.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="AaVGfOstme-ttgCn2zrt-8">
      <bpmn:text>10101-20200 o&apos;tkazma &quot;Проведён&quot; holatga o&apos;tadi</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="iKXF78kSZBCXU4R-NW74-1">
      <bpmn:text>GTD dekloratsiyasida kirim summasini ko&apos;rsatish</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="kbnzB_i5yze8lPXyVHQt-9">
      <bpmn:text>Har kuni kamida 1 marotaba</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="kbnzB_i5yze8lPXyVHQt-32">
      <bpmn:text>Dasturdan &quot;Электронная конвертaция&quot; tugma bosilganda o&apos;tkazmalar avtomat shakllanadi</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="kbnzB_i5yze8lPXyVHQt-43">
      <bpmn:text>Agarda valyuta qoldig&apos;i bir nechta h/r da aniqlansa, USM orqali mijoz bilan bog&apos;laniladi va qaysi valyuta h/r bo&apos;yicha konvertatsiya amaliyotini amalga oshirish kelishiladi</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="UFVNZuhKLCQogPJXVkFR-0">
      <bpmn:text>Balansdan tashqari h/r ochish. Referens biriktirish. Bank daromadini undirish (90961-96316)</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="ykmDBtOPICIkznXJkLJ3-6">
      <bpmn:text>Kamchilik aniqlansa SWIFT orqali xabar berish (MT734/750). To&apos;lovga qabul qilinsa MT756 bo&apos;yicha xabar berish</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
  </bpmn:process>

